格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"WeChat channel for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1408587744","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-wechat","slug":"xcisxc29/dsh-wechat","topics":["ai-agent","automation","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","remote-control","wechat","wechat-bot"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"WeChat channel for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-wechat-plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Control DeepSeek Harness from WeChat: chat on your phone, and the DSH agent on your computer does th"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" DeepSeek Harness from WeChat: chat on your phone, and the DSH agent on your computer does the\nwork."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"No OpenClaw, and no public IP required."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"**Runs on the current DSH desktop app** — developed and tested against DSH `0.2.1-rc.3`, and kept\ncu"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"rrent as the desktop app moves on. A lot of community plugins quietly stopped working when DSH\nupdat"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ed; this one is maintained alongside it, and every change is released through CI."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The screenshot above is the whole idea in one frame: the PC is **locked**, and the phone is still\nus"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ing it. At 16:16 the phone asks for a file on that machine's desktop and for the time on its clock —"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"\nboth come back, the two status bars read the same minute, and underneath is the window that did the"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"\nwork, with both requests already answered in the session list."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"中文说明"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **Text both ways.** Your WeChat message becomes a DSH prompt; the reply comes back to WeChat.\n- **"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"Photos, files, voice, video** — both directions. Attachments are saved into the session workspace\nan"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"d handed to the agent; the agent can send files back with `send_to_wechat`.\n- **One WeChat chat, man"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"y DSH sessions.** `/new`, `/list`, `/switch`, `/model`, `/current`, `/cancel` — or just\nsay \"switch "},{"id":"p9s5","text":"to the other one\".\n- **Answer permission prompts from your phone.** Approvals and multiple-choice qu"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"estions are sent to\nWeChat and answered with a number, so being away from the desk does not stall th"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"e agent.\n- **Settings page** under **Settings → WeChat**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## What it looks like"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| :--------------------------------------------------------------------------: | :------------------"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"--------------------------------------------------: |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"| **Proactive push.** A session can message you on its own. Here a \"wake me at 16:39\" lands while a "},{"id":"p12s2","text":"game is open — the agent reaches the phone, not the other way round. | **Any workspace, not just the"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" WeChat one.** This session lives in `workplace` and still pushes to your phone. Which conversations"},{"id":"p12s4","text":" may do that is a setting. |"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"| **Files both ways.** Left: it edits a file on the PC and sends the result back. Right: you send it"},{"id":"p13s2","text":" a document from the phone and ask what it says. | **Voice in, pictures out.** Speak the request ins"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"tead of typing it. Ask for an image and it searches, downloads and sends one, source included. |"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"|                                                                              | **Settings → WeChat"},{"id":"p14s2","text":".** Permission preset per conversation, proactive push, attachment merge window, reply limits, comma"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"nd reference, logs. |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**For the DSH desktop app.** It needs DSH's workspace, tool and UI services — the standard desktop\nc"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"omposition — on a machine that stays on. Tested against `0.2.1-rc.3`, and updated alongside the\ndesk"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"on — on a machine that stays on. Tested against `0.2.1-rc.3`, and updated alongside the\ndesktop app."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Open the **plugin** entry in the sidebar and choose **添加插件** (add plugin). The field takes a package"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"\nname, a Git URL, a tarball, or a local path."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"> ### The name to install is `dsh-wechat-plugin`\n>\n> The repository is called `dsh-wechat`, but the "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"package is not: **copy `dsh-wechat-plugin` rather than\n> typing it, and mind the `-plugin`.** The in"},{"id":"p18s3","text":"stall command has to match the package name exactly."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"From npm — nothing to configure"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Add a version if you need one: `dsh-wechat-plugin@0.36.5`."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"From GitHub — builds itself, for tracking a branch or a commit"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"DSH clones the repository and builds it. **pnpm will stop the build once and ask you to allow it** —"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"\nthat is expected, and it is how any Git-hosted plugin builds. DSH reports which key to add; it look"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"s\nlike this, in `~/.dsh/profiles/desktop/pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Most people do not need this. Reach for it to pin a commit or follow a branch, or when npm is\nunreac"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"eople do not need this. Reach for it to pin a commit or follow a branch, or when npm is\nunreachable."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Wait for the install to finish, click **立即启用** (enable now), and restart DSH."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Install from a terminal instead"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The app drives `pnpm` underneath, so the same thing headlessly:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"You then have to enable the bundle yourself — which is what **立即启用** does for you — in\n`~/.dsh/profi"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"les/desktop/package.json`:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Install from a locally built tarball"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## Security"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"**Only you can reach it.** The channel talks to Tencent's official iLink gateway, and nothing else —"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"\nno third-party service, no self-hosted relay in the middle. When you scan the QR code, the bot is\n*"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"*cryptographically bound to your WeChat account**: the token it receives embeds your `ilink_user_id`"},{"id":"p37s4","text":",\nand the service only ever delivers messages from that one account. The bot is not a WeChat contact"},{"id":"p37s5","text":" —\nit has no shareable card, nothing searches for it, and nobody can add it. There is no \"someone el"},{"id":"p37s6","text":"se\ncould message it\" surface, which is why no allowlist exists: the protocol already is one."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Two things are still true and worth knowing:"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"**Conversations from WeChat run with full permissions by default** — the agent does not ask before i"},{"id":"p39s2","text":"t\nacts. That is deliberate: a permission prompt is delivered to WeChat and the task then waits there"},{"id":"p39s3","text":", so\non a phone every command would stall until you answered a conversation you had walked away from"},{"id":"p39s4","text":". Set\n**Permissions for WeChat conversations** to `Follow the DSH setting` in the settings page if y"},{"id":"p39s5","text":"ou want\nthe same guardrails you have at the desk."},{"id":"p40s1","text":"**The agent runs as you.** It can execute commands and read and write files, with your user's\npermis"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"sions — that is what it is for, and it means anything you can do on this machine, it can do.\nSo: ski"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"m what you asked for before walking away, and **lock the screen** when you leave. Locking does\nnot s"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"top the agent (see the user guide), and it keeps anyone passing by out of your desktop."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**Any session on this machine can push to your WeChat by default.** That is what makes \"tell me when"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" it\nis done\" work: the session doing the work is usually not the one your WeChat conversation is bou"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"nd to,\nand without this it could not report its own result. Turn off **Let other sessions push to We"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"Chat** to\nrestore the stricter rule, where only the bound session may send."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

