is for, and it means anything you can do on this machine, it can do.\nSo: ski"},{"id":"p40s3","text":"m what you asked for before walking away, and **lock the screen** when you leave. Locking does\nnot s"},{"id":"p40s4","text":"top the agent (see the user guide), and it keeps anyone passing by out of your desktop."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"**Any session on this machine can push to your WeChat by default.** That is what makes \"tell me when"},{"id":"p41s2","text":" it\nis done\" work: the session doing the work is usually not the one your WeChat conversation is bou"},{"id":"p41s3","text":"nd to,\nand without this it could not report its own result. Turn off **Let other sessions push to We"},{"id":"p41s4","text":"Chat** to\nrestore the stricter rule, where only the bound session may send."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"},{"content":"上次校验失败；重新生成完整对象。evidence本次只选1至2条，每个编号必须从实际输入列表复制，不得推算或补造编号。保持摘要简洁，limitations最多3条。错误：["evidence","evidence"]","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
